= Semantic vocabulary review =

This maintenance category identifies pages whose explicitly supplied [[Property:Entity type|entity type]] or [[Property:Domain|domain]] is not yet listed in the reviewed BITwiki baseline vocabulary.

Such a value is '''not a reason to reject the article or substitute an inaccurate classification'''. The page's supplied value remains visible and available for review.

Editorial review should determine whether the value:
* identifies a genuinely new and useful subject type or domain;
* is a spelling, synonym, or narrower formulation of an existing value;
* belongs in a category or descriptive prose instead of a first-class semantic value;
* warrants an explicit schema update and adjustment of related queries or navigation.

Do not silently reclassify content or clear this category merely to obtain a green status. The review category is generated by [[Module:Structure]]; it is not an epistemic-status judgment.

